  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Pandemic, Prevention, Preparedness  Response Through One Health Approach in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To enhance multisectoral early warning surveillance systems to promptly detect diseases, immediately report and timely confirm events of significance toward achieving 7-1-7 global goal. To strengthen the national laboratory network and diagnostic capacity to accurately and timely confirm priority diseases, events and conditions. To build a skilled and competent One Health oriented workforce for sustainable and functional public health surveillance and response at all levels of the health system and the effective implementation of the IHR</narrative>
  </description>
